BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:Channel 4
DESCRIPTION:In between contributions from former contestants and relatives
  of current contestants\, this episode will answer many questions\, inclu
 ding: can Matt Lucas conquer his vertigo? Where did Chloe Petts find such
  a giant syringe? And why is Alex Horne flopping about in flippers and bu
 tterfly wings? Greg Davies dishes out points when they're deserved and wi
 thholds them when they're not as he tries to make sense of Nina Conti fil
 ling her face with citrus fruits\, Isy Suttie locating her saliva on Alex
 's jacket and Richard Ayoade chucking a doll's head at a gargoyle.
